  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『ARMORED CORE VI FIRES OF RUBICON』のアイテムが『30 MINUTES MISSIONS』シリーズで商品化。",
      "en": "\"ARMORED CORE VI FIRES OF RUBICON \" items are commercialized in the \" 30 MINUTES MISSIONS\" series."
    },
    {
      "ja": "シリーズのキーコンセプト「シンプル組み立て」「カスタム遊び」のもと、RaD製AC「CC-2000 ORBITER」が登場！",
      "en": "Based on the series' key concepts of \"simple assembly \" and \" custom play,\" RaD's AC \" CC-2000 ORBITER\" is now available!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部、コア、腕部、脚部それぞれにシリーズ共通構造を採用し、ゲーム内同様に「アセンブル」をプラモデルで楽しめる。",
      "en": "• The head, core, arms, and legs each use the same structure as the series, allowing you to enjoy \"assembling\" the plastic model just like in the game."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 両肩武器と一部左手武器の取り付けには3mmジョイントを採用し様々なアセンブルに対応可能。",
      "en": "• 3mm joints are used to attach both shoulder weapons and some left-handed weapons, allowing for a variety of assemblies."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 速射型リニアライフル「LR-036 CURTIS」が付属。",
      "en": "• Rapid-fire linear rifle \"LR-036 CURTIS\" is included."
    }
